iv class=\"thrive-colors-palette-config\" style=\"display: none !important\">__CONFIG_colors_palette__{\"active_palette\":0,\"config\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"name\":\"Main Accent\",\"parent\":-1}},\"gradients\":[]},\"palettes\":[{\"name\":\"Default Palette\",\"value\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"val\":\"var(--tcb-skin-color-0)\"}},\"gradients\":[]}}]}__CONFIG_colors_palette__<\/div>\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/cyberizegroup.com\/growth-call\/\" class=\"tcb-button-link tcb-plain-text\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tcb-button-texts\"><span class=\"tcb-button-text thrv-inline-text\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977cb3d59\" style=\"\">Book My Call<\/span><\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_contentbox_shortcode thrv-content-box tve-elem-default-pad\">\n\t<div class=\"tve-content-box-background\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"tve-cb\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element\"><h2 data-css=\"tve-u-19977ce6e96\" style=\"\"><strong>The Three-Part System That Works Now<\/strong><\/h2><p>Think of your ad strategy as a funnel with three campaigns. Each one has its role:<\/p><ul class=\"\"><li><strong>Prospecting \u2013 Find the Winners<\/strong>: Launch a CBO campaign with broad targeting, start lean (~$30\/day), test 5\u20138 creatives weekly, and promote winners.<\/li><li><strong>Remarketing \u2013 Build Trust<\/strong>: Target warm audiences, use testimonials and FAQs, dedicate ~20% of daily spend.<\/li><li><strong>Scaling \u2013 Maximize Return<\/strong>: Move proven ads into a scaling campaign, start with $100\u2013$200\/day, and raise budgets 5\u201310% gradually.<\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\"tcb-clear\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ced3a0\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv-button thrv-button-v2 tcb-local-vars-root\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ceb420\">\n\t<div class=\"thrive-colors-palette-config\" style=\"display: none !important\">__CONFIG_colors_palette__{\"active_palette\":0,\"config\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"name\":\"Main Accent\",\"parent\":-1}},\"gradients\":[]},\"palettes\":[{\"name\":\"Default Palette\",\"value\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"val\":\"var(--tcb-skin-color-0)\"}},\"gradients\":[]}}]}__CONFIG_colors_palette__<\/div>\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/cyberizegroup.com\/growth-call\/\" class=\"tcb-button-link tcb-plain-text\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tcb-button-texts\"><span class=\"tcb-button-text thrv-inline-text\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ceb421\" style=\"\">get my strategy plan<\/span><\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_contentbox_shortcode thrv-content-box tve-elem-default-pad\">\n\t<div class=\"tve-content-box-background\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"tve-cb\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element\">\t<h2 style=\"color: var(--tcb-skin-color-0) !important; --tcb-applied-color: var$(--tcb-skin-color-0) !important;\" class=\"\"><strong>Build a Playbook That Wins<\/strong><\/h2><p data-css=\"tve-u-19977d1012f\" style=\"\">The Andromeda update made one thing clear: your creative does the targeting.<\/p><ul class=\"\"><li><strong>Research First<\/strong>: Define who your customer is, what problem they need solved, and why your offer is unique.<\/li><li><strong>Creative Angles<\/strong>: Pain points, desires, objections, and promises.<\/li><li><strong>Formats<\/strong>: Rotate static images, UGC, videos, and before\/after shots.<\/li><li><strong>Copy Framework<\/strong>: Hook \u2192 Pain \u2192 Relief \u2192 Process \u2192 Proof \u2192 CTA.<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_contentbox_shortcode thrv-content-box tve-elem-default-pad\">\n\t<div class=\"tve-content-box-background\" style=\"--tve-border-width: 3px; border-left: 3px solid var(--tcb-skin-color-0) !important;\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977d230cc\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"tve-cb\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element\">\t<p data-css=\"tve-u-19977d29d6f\" style=\"\"><img role=\"img\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\"\ud83d\udca1\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/1f4a1.svg\"> Tip: Refresh creatives weekly. Creative fatigue kills performance faster than poor targeting.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_contentbox_shortcode thrv-content-box tve-elem-default-pad\">\n\t<div class=\"tve-content-box-background\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"tve-cb\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element\">\t<h2 style=\"\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977d4b376\"><strong>Scale Without Losing Control<\/strong><\/h2><p>Manual bidding helps you stay profitable while scaling:<\/p><ul class=\"\"><li>Set bid caps just below your break-even CPA.<\/li><li>Raise bids slowly in small increments.<\/li><li>Ensure budgets are about 20\u00d7 your target CPA.<\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class=\"tcb-clear\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ced3a0\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv-button thrv-button-v2 tcb-local-vars-root\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ceb420\">\n\t<div class=\"thrive-colors-palette-config\" style=\"display: none !important\">__CONFIG_colors_palette__{\"active_palette\":0,\"config\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"name\":\"Main Accent\",\"parent\":-1}},\"gradients\":[]},\"palettes\":[{\"name\":\"Default Palette\",\"value\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"val\":\"var(--tcb-skin-color-0)\"}},\"gradients\":[]}}]}__CONFIG_colors_palette__<\/div>\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/cyberizegroup.com\/growth-call\/\" class=\"tcb-button-link tcb-plain-text\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tcb-button-texts\"><span class=\"tcb-button-text thrv-inline-text\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ceb421\" style=\"\">start scaling smarter<\/span><\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_contentbox_shortcode thrv-content-box tve-elem-default-pad\">\n\t<div class=\"tve-content-box-background\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"tve-cb\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element\">\t<h2 style=\"\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977d53c00\" class=\"\"><strong>Your New Weekly Routine<\/strong><\/h2><p>Consistency comes from repetition. Here\u2019s your rhythm:<\/p><ol class=\"\"><li>Test broadly in Prospecting.<\/li><li>Move winners into Scaling.<\/li><li>Retarget warm audiences.<\/li><li>Refresh creatives every week.<\/li><li>Track results in a playbook.<\/li><\/ol><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_contentbox_shortcode thrv-content-box tve-elem-default-pad\">\n\t<div class=\"tve-content-box-background\" style=\"\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977d63811\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"tve-cb\" style=\"\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977d65c56\"><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv_text_element\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Ready to Stop Wasting Ad Spend?<\/strong><\/h2><p style=\"text-align: center;\">The Andromeda update didn\u2019t kill Facebook ads\u2014it just changed the rules. With the right structure, creative, and cost control, you can get your momentum back.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"thrv_wrapper thrv-button thrv-button-v2 tcb-local-vars-root\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977d6a641\">\n\t<div class=\"thrive-colors-palette-config\" style=\"display: none !important\">__CONFIG_colors_palette__{\"active_palette\":0,\"config\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"name\":\"Main Accent\",\"parent\":-1}},\"gradients\":[]},\"palettes\":[{\"name\":\"Default Palette\",\"value\":{\"colors\":{\"62516\":{\"val\":\"var(--tcb-skin-color-0)\"}},\"gradients\":[]}}]}__CONFIG_colors_palette__<\/div>\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/cyberizegroup.com\/growth-call\/\" class=\"tcb-button-link tcb-plain-text\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tcb-button-texts\"><span class=\"tcb-button-text thrv-inline-text\" data-css=\"tve-u-19977ceb421\" style=\"\">Book my call<\/span><\/span>\n\t<\/a>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>","tve_custom_css":"@media (min-width: 300px){:not(#tve) [data-css=\"tve-u-19977ca6cef\"] { font-family: Poppins !important; --g-regular-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3em !important; }[data-css=\"tve-u-19977caf507\"] .tcb-button-link { letter-spacing: 2px; background-color: transparent !important; background-image: linear-gradient(var(--tcb-local-color-62516, rgb(19, 114, 211)), var(--tcb-local-color-62516, rgb(19, 114, 211))); --tve-applied